<title>SWEDEN: S&amp;P raises Sweden's outlook to stable.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P raises Sweden's outlook to stable.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit rating agency Standard &amp; Poor's (S&amp;P) said on Friday that it had raised its outlook for Sweden to stable from negative while affirming the country's longterm credit rating at AA+.</p>
</text>
